      "html": "\n      <div class=\"nx nx-hero hero-with-cards\">\n        <div class=\"nx-hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('img/rubros/estetica/hero.jpg')\">\n          <div class=\"container position-relative\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-6 py-5\">\n              <h2 class=\"nx-display\">Tu piel, <span class=\"em\">en buenas manos.</span></h2>\n              <p class=\"nx-lead\">Tratamientos faciales y corporales personalizados, con profesionales matriculadas.</p>\n              <a class=\"btn-nx mt-4\" href=\"mailto:hola@example.com\">Reservá tu turno <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nx-hero-cards\">\n              <article class=\"nx-hero-card\">\n                <span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-search-heart\"></i></span>\n                <div><h3>Diagnóstico a medida</h3><p>Evaluamos tu piel antes de cada tratamiento.</p></div>\n              </article>\n              <article class=\"nx-hero-card\">\n                <span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i></span>\n                <div><h3>Aparatología certificada</h3><p>Equipos de última generación y protocolos seguros.</p></div>\n              </article>\n              <article class=\"nx-hero-card\">\n                <span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-heart-pulse\"></i></span>\n                <div><h3>Seguimiento real</h3><p>Te acompañamos entre sesiones para cuidar los resultados.</p></div>\n              </article>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    "
