      "id": "reserva-turno-compleja",
      "width": "full",
      "html": "<div class=\"nx nx-pad nx-paper\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-4 mb-lg-5\">\n          <p class=\"nx-kicker\">Reservas online</p>\n          <h2 class=\"nx-display\">Reservá tu turno</h2>\n          <p class=\"nx-lead mx-auto\">Cuatro pasos y listo. Ves el resumen y el precio antes de confirmar.</p>\n        </div>\n        <form class=\"bk-wizard\" data-booking data-book-form data-book-requires=\"servicio,profesional,dia,horario\">\n          <ol class=\"bk-steps\" data-book-steps>\n            <li><button type=\"button\" data-book-goto=\"1\"><span>1</span> Tratamiento</button></li>\n            <li><button type=\"button\" data-book-goto=\"2\"><span>2</span> Profesional</button></li>\n            <li><button type=\"button\" data-book-goto=\"3\"><span>3</span> Día y horario</button></li>\n            <li><button type=\"button\" data-book-goto=\"4\"><span>4</span> Tus datos</button></li>\n          </ol>\n          <div class=\"bk-wizard-grid\">\n            <div class=\"bk-stage\">\n              <div data-book-hide-on-done>\n                <section class=\"bk-step\" data-book-step=\"1\" data-book-requires=\"servicio\">\n                  <h3 class=\"bk-step-title\">¿Qué tratamiento querés hacer?</h3>\n                  <div class=\"bk-services\"><button class=\"bk-service\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"servicio\" data-book-set=\"duracion:45 min|precio:$ 18.000\"><span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-droplet\"></i></span><strong>Limpieza facial profunda</strong><small><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> 45 min</small><span class=\"bk-price\">$ 18.000</span></button><button class=\"bk-service\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"servicio\" data-book-set=\"duracion:30 min|precio:$ 12.000\"><span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-magic\"></i></span><strong>Láser · zona chica</strong><small><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> 30 min</small><span class=\"bk-price\">$ 12.000</span></button><button class=\"bk-service\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"servicio\" data-book-set=\"duracion:90 min|precio:$ 32.000\"><span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-flower2\"></i></span><strong>Drenaje linfático completo</strong><small><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> 90 min</small><span class=\"bk-price\">$ 32.000</span></button><button class=\"bk-service\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"servicio\" data-book-set=\"duracion:30 min|precio:$ 10.000\"><span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-search-heart\"></i></span><strong>Evaluación de piel</strong><small><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> 30 min</small><span class=\"bk-price\">$ 10.000</span></button></div>\n                </section>\n                <section class=\"bk-step\" data-book-step=\"2\" data-book-requires=\"profesional\" hidden>\n                  <h3 class=\"bk-step-title\">¿Con quién querés atenderte?</h3>\n                  <div class=\"bk-pros\"><button class=\"bk-pro\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"profesional\" data-label=\"Valeria Ríos\"><img src=\"img/rubros/estetica/pro-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"><strong>Valeria Ríos</strong><small>Cosmiatra</small></button><button class=\"bk-pro\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"profesional\" data-label=\"Tomás Herrera\"><img src=\"img/rubros/estetica/pro-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"><strong>Tomás Herrera</strong><small>Cosmetólogo</small></button><button class=\"bk-pro\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"profesional\" data-label=\"Claudia Méndez\"><img src=\"img/rubros/estetica/pro-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"><strong>Claudia Méndez</strong><small>Dermatocosmiatra</small></button><button class=\"bk-pro\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"profesional\" data-label=\"Sin preferencia\"><span class=\"bk-pro-any\"><i class=\"bi bi-shuffle\"></i></span><strong>Sin preferencia</strong><small>Primer turno libre</small></button></div>\n                </section>\n                <section class=\"bk-step\" data-book-step=\"3\" data-book-requires=\"dia,horario\" hidden>\n                  <h3 class=\"bk-step-title\">Elegí día y horario</h3>\n                  <div class=\"row g-4\">\n                    <div class=\"col-md-7\"><div class=\"bk-cal\" data-book-cal></div></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-md-5\" data-book-slots>\n                      <p class=\"bk-slot-title\">Mañana</p><div class=\"bk-slots\"><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">09:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">09:45</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">10:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">11:15</button></div><p class=\"bk-slot-title\">Tarde</p><div class=\"bk-slots\"><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">14:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">14:45</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">15:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">16:15</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">17:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">17:45</button></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </section>\n                <section class=\"bk-step\" data-book-step=\"4\" hidden>\n                  <h3 class=\"bk-step-title\">Completá tus datos</h3>\n                  <div class=\"row g-3\">\n                    <label class=\"bk-field col-md-6\"><span>Nombre y apellido</span><input class=\"bk-input\" name=\"nombre\" required autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Ej: Ana Pérez\" data-book-field=\"nombre\"></label>\n                    <label class=\"bk-field col-md-6\"><span>Teléfono</span><input class=\"bk-input\" type=\"tel\" name=\"telefono\" required autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+54 11 5555-0000\" data-book-field=\"telefono\"></label>\n                    <label class=\"bk-field col-12\"><span>Email</span><input class=\"bk-input\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"tu@email.com\" data-book-field=\"email\"></label>\n                    <label class=\"bk-field col-12\"><span>¿Algo que debamos saber? <em>(opcional)</em></span><textarea class=\"bk-input\" name=\"notas\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Contanos si tenés alguna alergia o tratamiento previo\"></textarea></label>\n                    <label class=\"bk-check col-12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"recordatorio\" checked> Quiero un recordatorio por WhatsApp el día anterior</label>\n                  </div>\n                </section>\n                <p class=\"bk-msg\" data-book-msg role=\"status\"></p>\n                <div class=\"bk-nav\">\n                  <button class=\"btn-nx-outline\" type=\"button\" data-book-prev><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-left\"></i> Atrás</button>\n                  <button class=\"btn-nx\" type=\"button\" data-book-next>Continuar <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"bk-done\" data-book-done hidden role=\"status\">\n                <span class=\"bk-done-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i></span>\n                <h3>¡Listo, <span data-book-out=\"nombre\"></span>!</h3>\n                <p>Tu turno de <b data-book-out=\"servicio\"></b> con <b data-book-out=\"profesional\"></b> quedó confirmado para el <b data-book-out=\"dia\"></b> a las <b data-book-out=\"horario\"></b>. Te mandamos los detalles a <b data-book-out=\"email\"></b>.</p>\n                <div class=\"bk-done-actions\">\n                  <button class=\"btn-nx\" type=\"button\" data-book-ics><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-plus\"></i> Agregar al calendario</button>\n                  <button class=\"btn-nx-outline\" type=\"button\" data-book-reset>Reservar otro turno</button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <aside class=\"bk-summary\" aria-label=\"Resumen de la reserva\">\n              <h3>Tu reserva</h3>\n              <dl>\n                <div><dt><i class=\"bi bi-bag-heart\"></i> Tratamiento</dt><dd data-book-out=\"servicio\" data-empty=\"—\"></dd></div>\n                <div><dt><i class=\"bi bi-person\"></i> Profesional</dt><dd data-book-out=\"profesional\" data-empty=\"—\"></dd></div>\n                <div><dt><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3\"></i> Día</dt><dd data-book-out=\"dia\" data-empty=\"—\"></dd></div>\n                <div><dt><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> Horario</dt><dd data-book-out=\"horario\" data-empty=\"—\"></dd></div>\n                <div><dt><i class=\"bi bi-hourglass-split\"></i> Duración</dt><dd data-book-out=\"duracion\" data-empty=\"—\"></dd></div>\n              </dl>\n              <p class=\"bk-total\"><span>Total</span><strong data-book-out=\"precio\" data-empty=\"$ 0\"></strong></p>\n              <p class=\"bk-policy\"><i class=\"bi bi-shield-check\"></i> Pagás en el lugar. Cancelás sin costo hasta 24 h antes.</p>\n            </aside>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n        <p class=\"nx-note text-center\">Tratamientos, precios y profesionales de ejemplo.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>"
    },
